   "height": 30.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "改善点",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "改善点",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10989,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48615,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1568",
   "x": 1426.9999999999995,
   "y": 1602.0,
   "width": 369.99999999999994,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. MainEngine::Instance() が 65 回残っている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. MainEngine::Instance() が 65 回残っている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 10996,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48646,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1569",
   "x": 1426.9999999999995,
   "y": 1622.0,
   "width": 622.0000000000005,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    多いのは App.cpp(13)・InputManager(6)・エディター(29)。\n    どれも EngineServices / EditorContext / PassContext に経路があるので、\n    そちらへ寄せればさらに減らせる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    多いのは App.cpp(13)・InputManager(6)・エディター(29)。\n    どれも EngineServices / EditorContext / PassContext に経路があるので、\n    そちらへ寄せればさらに減らせる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11003,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48677,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1570",
   "x": 1426.9999999999995,
   "y": 1702.0,
   "width": 313.8,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. シーンの解放順はアプリ側が持っている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. シーンの解放順はアプリ側が持っている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11010,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48708,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1571",
   "x": 1426.9999999999995,
   "y": 1722.0,
   "width": 750.0000000000006,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    SceneManager の持ち主は MainEngine だが、Release はゲームより先に Application が呼ぶ。\n    シーンのオブジェクトがゲームの記録(GameDataResource)を指しているため。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    SceneManager の持ち主は MainEngine だが、Release はゲームより先に Application が呼ぶ。\n    シーンのオブジェクトがゲームの記録(GameDataResource)を指しているため。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11017,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48739,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1572",
   "x": 1426.9999999999995,
   "y": 1782.0,
   "width": 346.5999999999999,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "3. ResourceManager::Instance() は残す判断",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3. ResourceManager::Instance() は残す判断",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11024,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 48770,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1573",
   "x": 1426.9999999999995,
   "y": 1802.0,
   "width": 675.4,
   "height": 40.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ResourceRef<T> が値として資産に埋まり、コピー・破棄のたびに参照カウントを触る。\n    引数で渡す口が無いので、ここだけは入口として残している。",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ResourceRef<T> が値として資産に埋まり、コピー・破棄のたびに参照カウントを触る。\n    引数で渡す口が無いので、ここだけは入口として残している。",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
